## EverGenie License (English)

Copyright (c) 2026 EverGenie contributors. All rights reserved to the extent permitted by law, except as
permitted below.

This is **not** an open-source license. The source code is public: you may read it, use it and modify it for
yourself, but you may not sell it or use it in other products.

**Scope.** "EverGenie" means everything in this repository and in the EverGenie release packages: the source
code, binaries, scripts and documentation, and the official characters (the persona cards under
`packages/official/personas/` and the avatars, outfit images and videos in the official character packs, which
EverGenie downloads to your computer). Third-party components are not covered (the release packages also
include the licenses of components compiled into the binaries); they keep their own licenses,
listed in [LICENSES/](LICENSES/). Names of mythological or folkloric figures are not claimed; only the written
character settings and the images themselves are.

**You may:**

- Install and use EverGenie on computers you own or manage, for personal or work use; a company or team may
  run it for its own members, as long as the people using it are not charged.
- Redistribute EverGenie **unmodified**, free of charge, provided this file is included.
- Modify EverGenie (including the persona cards) for your own use.
- Share modified versions of EverGenie or of the persona cards **free of charge**, provided this file is
  included and your changes are noted (for example through the git history). A modified version as a whole
  remains under this license; you may not add broader or narrower terms.
- Share through any channel, including mirrors and public forks on GitHub.
- "Free of charge" means no fee, and no payment or subscription required to obtain it.
- The official characters may only be shared together with EverGenie, not on their own.

**What you make is yours.** Packages, characters and outfits you create yourself, and the data and content you
produce with EverGenie, are yours and are not restricted by this license (including the restrictions below):
you may share, license or sell them as you like, provided they do not include EverGenie's own code or official
characters (persona cards, images, videos). Anything copied from an official package or official persona card
and then modified is a modified version of EverGenie and falls under "You may" above.

**Without prior written permission you may not:**

- Sell, rent or sublicense EverGenie or any part of it (including modified versions), or include it in a paid
  product, service or content.
- Run EverGenie as a paid service for others.
- Use EverGenie's code or official characters (or modified versions) in any product or service other than
  EverGenie.
- Remove or alter this license or the copyright notice.

**Contributions.** By submitting a change (for example a pull request) you agree that it is released under this
license, and that the EverGenie copyright holders may later release it under other terms.

**No warranty.** EVERGENIE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT
NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO
EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN
ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH EVERGENIE OR THE USE OR OTHER
DEALINGS IN EVERGENIE.

To ask for a use not permitted above, open an issue in this repository. This license exists in Chinese and
English with the same meaning; if they differ, the Chinese version prevails.
